msgid "Adapt this workflow to your own system: the function accepts any 1D nearest-neighbor `SparsePauliOp`, so a different chain Hamiltonian, initial state, or set of observables runs the same PRE &rarr; FUNCTION &rarr; POST pipeline. See the full input/output contract in the [AQC Dynamics Template on GitHub](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/physics/aqc_trotter).\n"
msgstr "I-adapt ang workflow na ito sa iyong sariling sistema: tinatanggap ng function ang anumang 1D nearest-neighbor na `SparsePauliOp`, kaya't ang ibang chain Hamiltonian, initial state, o set ng observables ay tumatakbo sa parehong PRE &rarr; FUNCTION &rarr; POST pipeline. Tingnan ang buong input/output contract sa [AQC Dynamics Template sa GitHub](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates/tree/main/physics/aqc_trotter).\n"

